    <!-- Metadata Individuals: Glossary Terms -->
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_Contract"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Contract</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores the business attributes of commercial agreements associated with bookings, including contract type, term, renewal behavior, and support coverage level.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Contract</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Stores the business attributes of commercial agreements associated with bookings, including contract type, term, renewal behavior, and support coverage level.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_Customer"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Customer</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores descriptive information about customers that place orders and generate bookings, including segment, industry, account tier, and headquarters location.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Customer</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Stores descriptive information about customers that place orders and generate bookings, including segment, industry, account tier, and headquarters location.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_Date"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Date</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores calendar and fiscal date attributes used to analyze bookings over time.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Date</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Stores calendar and fiscal date attributes used to analyze bookings over time.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_Geography"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Geography</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores geographic attributes used to analyze bookings by sales region, theater, and country.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Geography</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Stores geographic attributes used to analyze bookings by sales region, theater, and country.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_Partner"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Partner</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores information about channel and direct partners involved in the sales process, including partner type, partner tier, and route to market.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Partner</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Stores information about channel and direct partners involved in the sales process, including partner type, partner tier, and route to market.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_Product"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Product</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores descriptive information about products and offers sold to customers, including product family, technology domain, offer type, and business entity.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Product</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Stores descriptive information about products and offers sold to customers, including product family, technology domain, offer type, and business entity.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_SalesRepresentative"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Sales Representative</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores information about sales personnel responsible for managing customer relationships and booking transactions.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Sales Representative</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Stores information about sales personnel responsible for managing customer relationships and booking transactions.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_BookingTransaction"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Booking Transaction</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores individual completed sales booking transactions with related financial measures and links to customer, product, partner, geography, sales representative, contract, and date dimensions.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Stores individual completed sales booking transactions with related financial measures and links to customer, product, partner, geography, sales representative, contract, and date dimensions.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- Metadata Individuals: Business Rules -->
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#rule_RenewalBooking"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#BusinessRule"/><rdfs:label>Renewal Booking</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>A booking transaction is considered a renewal booking when the booking type indicates renewal or the renewal indicator identifies the transaction as a renewal.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>A booking transaction is considered a renewal booking when the booking_type attribute is renewal or is_renewal indicates renewal.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#rule_NetNewBooking"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#BusinessRule"/><rdfs:label>Net New Booking</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>A booking transaction is considered a net new booking when the booking type indicates a new sale and the transaction is not classified as a renewal.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>A booking transaction is considered net new when booking_type indicates new sale and is_renewal does not indicate renewal.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#rule_BusinessProcessDocumentUnreadable"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#BusinessRule"/><rdfs:label>Business Process Document Readability Warning</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>The business process document QuoteToBooking.docx could not be decoded as UTF-8 by the repository reader, so ontology business rule enrichment from process documentation is incomplete.</rdfs:comment><sourceEntity>QuoteToBooking.docx</sourceEntity><semanticDefinition>Validation warning captured during ontology generation.</semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>

